# Repo policy: the GitHub remote is public and holds ONLY the system architecture
# (CLAUDE.md, README, .claude/, 00-System/, and the empty folder skeleton).
# All learning content stays local: PDFs, images, resources, datasets AND the notes themselves
# (see 00-System/Conventions.md, "Repo scope").

